  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From the dimensional checking of the equation, we can say the dimensions of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></math></p><p>And dimensions of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>T</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Required value, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
